@startuml 25-break-glass
!include theme-oriolrius.puml
title Break-glass: planned emergency root
autonumber "<b>0."
actor "Marta\n(issuer)" as issuer
actor "Pau\n(on call, no root)" as pau
participant "PKI Manager" as pki
participant "acme-db\n(sshd)" as db
participant "Central log" as log
pau -> issuer : incident: need root on acme-db
issuer -> pki : Issue User Certificate\nprincipals: break-glass · TTL +1h
pki -> pki : audit: ssh.cert.issue\n(keyId, principals, serial 77)
pki --> issuer : alert: break-glass issued
issuer --> pau : certificate (1 hour)
pau -> db : ssh root@acme-db
db -> db : root file: sysadmins, break-glass -> match
db -> log : Accepted … ID pau@ops.example (serial 77) CA …
pau -> db : fix, then close the session
note over db : after 1 h: NEW logins fail.\nOpen sessions do not close by themselves.
issuer -> log : review: follow serial 77, post-mortem
note over issuer, log : Keep one OFFLINE way in for the day PKI Manager is down.
@enduml
